    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CLIPPER.CLASS\nWELCOME TO CLIPPER CLASS,\nPAN AM'S SPECIAL BUSINESS CLASS SECTION\nLibationso\nCocktails\nPremium Beer\nSelected Red and White Wines\nDelectationso\nApéritif\nCocktail tidbits\nContinental Appetizer\nChoice hors d'oeuvre savouries\nGrilled Filet Steak\nA select tenderloin steak.\nServed with Byron potatoes and broccoli florettes\nChicken Arlequin\nDelicate chicken simmered in savory sauce.\nServed with fried rice\nCoffee\nCheese and Crackers\nDessert\nTea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\n587.N006\n2001.080•017",
      "LONDON\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nThis view of the Thames embankment and Big Ben captures some of the charm of London. Every\nstudent of history should see the Houses of Parliament, Buckingham Palace, Westminster Abbey, and\nthe Tower of London. While it is one of the world's great centers of commerce, it is also a city of\nbeauty with extensive parks and gardens. The luxurious Inter-Continental London is situated adjacent\nto gracious Hyde Park and the Portman Inter-Continental Hotel is conveniently located at One\nPortman Square. Pan Am serves London every day on its Round-The-World flights and one can reach\nLondon on Pan Am from virtually anywhere in the world\nDAM."
    ],
